                </p>
                <a href="https://stripe.com/pricing" class="relative flex items-center justify-center gap-6 text-16 font-normal text-primary rounded-4 hover:text-primary-hover focus-visible:text-primary-hover focus-visible:shadow-focus transition-all duration-250 cursor-pointer group outline-none">
                    <span class="pb-2">
